</given-names></name><name><surname>Nelson</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Communication in the physical and the social sciences</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1970</year><volume>170</volume><fpage>1166</fpage><lpage>1173</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5478190</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chalmers</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Adams</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dickersin</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hetherington</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Tarnow-Mordi</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Meinert</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Tonascia</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Chalmers</surname><given-names>TC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A cohort study of summary reports of controlled trials</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>1990</year><volume>263</volume><fpage>1401</fpage><lpage>1405</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2304219</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.263.10.1401</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cheng</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Preston</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Ashby</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Hea</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Smyth</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Time to publication as full reports of abstracts of randomized controlled trials in cystic fibrosis</article-title><source>Pediatr Pulmonol</source><year>1998</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>101</fpage><lpage>105</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9727760</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/(SICI)1099-0496(199808)26:2&#x0003c;101::AID-PPUL5&#x0003e;3.3.CO;2-C</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dickersin</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Min</surname><given-names>Y-I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>NIH clinical trials and publication bias</article-title><source>Online J Curr Clin Trials</source><year>1993</year><volume>Doc No 50</volume></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dirk</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>From laboratory to scientific literature. The life and death of biomedical research results</article-title><source>Science Communication</source><year>1996</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>3</fpage><lpage>28</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Easterbrook</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Berlin</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Gopalan</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Matthews</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Publication bias in clinical research</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1991</year><volume>337</volume><fpage>867</fpage><lpage>872</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1672966</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0140-6736(91)90201-Y</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morrison</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Meeks</surname><given-names>GR</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>JN</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Cowan</surname><given-names>BD</given-names></n